[com_532]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_1
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=Open up the crew list to assign captains and crew to your current boat.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=unknown_3
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd

[com_533]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_2
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=A ship can't sail without a captain. Click this one or drag it to the captain's spot on the roster above to assign it.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=unknown_3
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd

[com_534]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_3
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=Our ship could sail, but the chance it'll succeed could be improved by adding crew; either drag them to a spot on the ship, or select the spot you wish to fill then click the crewman to assign them.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=unknown_3
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd

[com_535]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_6
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=You can change your ship's stats by equipping new components. Click on the "Deck Items 2" hotspot to see what you can equip.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=unknown_3
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd

[com_536]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_8
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=We could do with some more Seafaring, which we can get by swapping the currently equipped Small Crate of Food for some Weathered Rigging. Click on "Weathered Rigging" to see its stats.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=unknown_3
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd

[com_537]
type=text
x=11
y=8
width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_11
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=Looks like you're ready - the voyage has an excellent chance of success. Click here to send it on its way.
textlineheight=13
textalignh=unknown_3
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffebcd

