width=22
height=16
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_9
textfont=p12_full
fontmono=no
text=Click the "Activate" button to switch Food for Rigging. Your overall chance of success is the lowest of your Morale, Seafaring and Combat chances; by swapping some excess Morale for Seafaring your odds will improve.
textlineheight=13
